{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.20260527123406","title":"About the Book of Enoch adalah pengantar editorial, bukan teks inti","desc":"Bagian pengantar dalam edisi modern Book of Enoch harus dibaca sebagai framing historis dan apologetik, bukan sebagai bagian teks Enoch itu sendiri.","updated":1779935953056,"created":1779860052922,"tags":["zettel","enoch","historiography","textual-context"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.20260527123406","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"4a11a841f5db7de929fb24ad9c2c65d6","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260527123406","id":"zettel.20260527123406","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260527123406","id":"zettel.20260527123406","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.enoch","alias":"enoch","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.enoch"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260527123406","id":"zettel.20260527123406","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.historiography","alias":"historiography","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.historiography"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260527123406","id":"zettel.20260527123406","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.textual-context","alias":"textual-context","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.textual-context"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260527123406","id":"zettel.20260527123406","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-complete-book-of-enoch","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":3,"offset":466},"end":{"line":7,"column":48,"offset":511},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-complete-book-of-enoch"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260527123406","id":"zettel.20260527123406","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.history.enoch-textual-history","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":3,"offset":514},"end":{"line":8,"column":42,"offset":553},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.history.enoch-textual-history"}}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"about-the-book-of-enoch-adalah-pengantar-editorial-bukan-teks-inti\">About the Book of Enoch adalah pengantar editorial, bukan teks inti<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#about-the-book-of-enoch-adalah-pengantar-editorial-bukan-teks-inti\"></a></h1>\n<p>Bagian \"About the Book of Enoch\" dalam edisi modern bukan bagian teks Enoch kuno. Ini adalah pengantar editorial yang memberi pembaca kerangka: Enoch pernah dihormati, kemudian ditolak, lalu ditemukan kembali.</p>\n<p>Fungsi bagian ini lebih sebagai metadata pembacaan daripada isi teks. Klaim seperti \"Kristus menyetujui Book of Enoch\" atau \"ditolak dan dibakar\" harus diperlakukan sebagai klaim apologetik, bukan fakta filologis tanpa verifikasi.</p>\n<p>Referensi internal:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-complete-book-of-enoch\">The Complete Book of Enoch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.history.enoch-textual-history\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled class=\"task-before task-status\"><span class=\"task-status-text\">(published)</span>Enoch textual history: manuskrip dan tradisi</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">enoch (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">historiography (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">textual-context (Private)</a></li>